    "500 ml of cold water (4°C) burns ≈25 kcal to warm up to body temperature. 2 l/day = 100 \"free\" kcal. Nice, but it won't save your diet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
